+            Snowflake bitmap format:
+            - Small (< 5 unique values): 2-byte count (big-endian) + values (little-endian) + padding to 10 bytes
+            - Large (>= 5 unique values): 10-byte header (0x08 + 9 zeros) + values (little-endian)
